{"id":"3a2e311d286ab9b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-embed-chain.md","title":"Embedding Chain Theorem","display":"thm-embed-chain — Embedding Chain Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-embed-chain","aliases":["58-thm-embed-chain"],"display":"thm-embed-chain — Embedding Chain Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-woodin]]","[[58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness]]","[[58-df-v-alpha]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-embed-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-embed-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-embed-chain — Embedding Chain Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness\">58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> (Woodin基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}\\)</span> (Woodin-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (class-level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strongness witness)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}embed\\text{-}chain}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}embed\\text{-}chain}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strong for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; its exact upstream predicate expands to a possibly different class embedding for each target height below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Requiring one embedding with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(A)\\cap V_\\delta=A\">\\(j(A)\\cap V_\\delta=A\\)</span> would be substantially stronger and is not the standard Woodin characterization.</li>\n<li>The set-coded <code>ElementaryEmbedding_S</code> is not applied to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"5